{"title":"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three tenths plus four thousandths is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01a290dd52de79f657028bf5eff9237728d8411f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 4030 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 0.0403 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 0.304 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0.34 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 30.004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"554\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can convert each fraction into a decimal, and then add them.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/b/eabc5edfdab41f8a703e01a90ebe24fdbec66dc1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} = 0.3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"71\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/46700acd8e099ff18bb0b051f7a5e1b407db24cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{1000} = 0.004$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"108\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Adding these, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc15507e293317663e09a7a4c47fa0fb28c9182.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.3 + 0.004 = 0.300 + 0.004 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 0.304}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"330\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can combine the fractions using a common denominator, and then convert the result into a decimal.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/c/91c485fbe1db6c4d883845db71023b95d73791b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{10} + \\frac{4}{1000} = \\frac{3 \\times 100}{10 \\times 100} + \\frac{4 \\times 1}{1000 \\times 1} = \\frac{300}{1000} + \\frac{4}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"404\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17b47f400491bd6ae9f267c112e8665996556d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{300 + 4}{1000} = \\frac{304}{1000} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 0.304}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"260\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2016 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></